<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About' }) %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="px-3" id="main">
  <div class="hero-box text-center">
    <h1 class="homepage-title">About <span class="highlight">TrackR</span></h1>
    <p class="lead px-4">
      A course requirement tracker for University of Waterloo students, built to answer one
      question: am I on track to graduate?
    </p>

    <div class="text-start about-body">
      <h2>Where the requirements come from</h2>
      <p>
        Program requirements are transcribed from the
        <a href="https://uwaterloo.ca/academic-calendar/undergraduate-studies/catalog" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Undergraduate Studies Academic Calendar</a>, one JSON file per plan. Course data comes
        from the same calendar's public course listings, and ratings come from
        <a href="https://uwflow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UWFlow</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Programs covered</h2>
      <ul>
        <% programs.forEach(function (program) { %>
          <li><%= program.label %></li>
        <% }); %>
      </ul>

      <h2>What it does not do</h2>
      <p>
        TrackR checks the requirements a plan lists by name, plus the unit totals and cumulative
        average minimum from Table 1. It does not check co-op or PD sequences, term-by-term
        prerequisites, major averages (which are defined per plan), or academic standing. A plan
        that has no breadth or depth requirement in the calendar simply will not show those
        sections.
      </p>
      <p>
        The GPA figures are an approximation. Waterloo reports averages only as percentages and
        publishes no official conversion to a 4.0 scale.
      </p>

      <p class="constraint-note">
        This is a student project, not an official University of Waterloo tool. Always confirm your
        standing with an academic advisor.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-4">
      <a class="btn btn-get-started fw-bold" href="/">Check your progress</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
